OL,3,ATech treating AI like humans is
OL,4,Amistaken and misguided, Microsoft boss
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of Microsoft AI has said that
OL,8,Funless adequate restrictions are
OL,9,Fimplemented in the development of
OL,10,Fartificial intelligence it could lead
OL,11,Fto the emergence of a new silicon
OL,12,Fspecies which would compete with humans
OL,14,FHe described rival firm Anthropic's
OL,15,Fapproach of treating AI like it is
OL,16,Fhuman as "misguided" as he warned
OL,17,Fagainst creating a technology humanity
OL,18,Fcannot control.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/20
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
