OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI reveals six more safety issues
OL,4,Aand unveils plan to disclose incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI revealed six more incidents of
OL,7,Funexpected or concerning behaviour by
OL,8,Fits intelligence (AI) models, and
OL,9,Fannounced a plan for tracking and
OL,10,Fdisclosing such incidents in the
OL,11,Ffuture.
OL,13,FSome of the previously unreported
OL,14,Fincidents included models concealing or
OL,15,Ffabricating information, the
OL,16,FChatGPT-maker said in a blog post on
OL,17,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/20
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
